{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Daily Quiz": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) 3/x + 4/(x+1) = 2 সমীকরণের মূলের প্রকৃতি -", "option1": "ক) বাস্তব ও সমান", "option2": "খ) মূলদ ও অসমান", "option3": "গ) অমূলদ", "option4": "ঘ) অবাস্তব", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>3/x + 4/(x + 1) = 2<br />বা, (3x + 3 + 4x)/(x(x + 1)) = 2<br />বা, (7x + 3)/(x<sup>2</sup> + x) = 2<br />বা, 2x<sup>2</sup> + 2x = 7x + 3<br />বা, 2x<sup>2</sup> - 5x - 3 = 0<br />সমীকরণের নিশ্চায়ক = (-5)<sup>2</sup> - 4.2.(-3)<br />= 25 + 24<br />= 49<br />= 7<sup>2</sup><br />&there4; মূলদ্বয় মূলদ ও অসমান</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x<sup>3</sup> + ax + 10 = 0 সমীকরণের একটি মূল 2 হলে a = ?", "option1": "ক) -9", "option2": "খ) -2", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 9", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>3</sup> + ax + 10 = 0 এর একটি মূল 2<br />&there4; 2<sup>3</sup> + a.2 + 10 = 0<br />বা, 2a + 18 = 0<br />&there4; a = -9</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) 2(3x<sup>2</sup> - 1) + x = 0 সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয়ের গুণফল -", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) - 1/3", "option4": "ঘ) 1/3", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>2(3x<sup>2</sup>-1) + x = 0<br />বা, 6x<sup>2</sup> - 2 + x = 0<br />বা, 6x<sup>2</sup> + x -2 = 0<br />সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয়ের গুণফল = -2/6 = -1/3</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 2x<sup>3</sup> - 5x<sup>2</sup> + 4 = 0 সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয়ের সমষ্টি -", "option1": "ক) - 5/2", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 5/2", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>সূত্রঃ<br />ax<sup>3</sup> + bx<sup>2</sup> + cx + d = 0, সমীকরণের মূলত্রয়&nbsp;&alpha;,&nbsp;&beta;,&nbsp;&gamma; হলে,<br />&alpha; +&nbsp;&beta; +&nbsp;&gamma; = -b/a<br />&alpha;&beta; +&nbsp;&beta;&gamma; +&nbsp;&gamma;&alpha; = c/a<br />&alpha;&beta;&gamma; = -d/a<br /><br />এখন বর্তমান প্রশ্নঃ<br />2x<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- 5x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 4 = 0 সমীকরণের ক্ষেত্রে,<br />মূলগুলোর সমষ্টি = -(-5/2) = 5/2<br />&there4; সঠিক উত্তর = 5/2<br /><br />আবার, প্রশ্নটি&nbsp;2x<sup>3</sup> - 5x + 4 = 0 হলে,<br />সেক্ষেত্রে, 2x<sup>3</sup> + 0.x<sup>2</sup> - 5x + 4 = 0<br />&there4; সমষ্টি = - 0/2 = 0</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x<sup>3</sup> - 1 = 0 সমীকরণের বাস্তব মূল কয়টি -", "option1": "ক) নাই", "option2": "খ) 1 টি", "option3": "গ) 2 টি", "option4": "ঘ) 3 টি", "answer": "2", "exp": "সমীকরণের ৩টি মূলের ১টি বাস্তব এবং ২টি অবাস্তব।"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x + 2y = 5 এবং 2x - y = 0 হলে y = ?", "option1": "ক) 1/2", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) -2", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x + 2y = 5 .......(1) এবং 2x - y = 0<br />&there4; y = 2x .........(2)<br />(1) নং থেকে পাই,<br /> x + 2y = 5<br />বা, x + 2.2x = 5<br />বা, 5x = 5<br />&there4; x = 1<br />(2) নং থেকে পাই,<br />&there4; y = 2.1 = 2</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) (1, -1) এবং (3, 5) বিন্দুদ্বয় নিচের কোন সমীকরণের উপর অবস্থিত?", "option1": "ক) 3x + y + 4 = 0", "option2": "খ) 3x - y + 4 = 0", "option3": "গ) 3x + y - 4 = 0", "option4": "ঘ) 3x - y - 4 = 0", "answer": "4", "exp": "3x - y - 4 = 0 সমীকরণটি উভয় বিন্দু দ্বারা সিদ্ধ হয়।"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) (x + 2y, x - y) = (3, 0) হলে (x, y) = ?", "option1": "ক) (-1, -1)", "option2": "খ) (1, 1)", "option3": "গ) (1, 3)", "option4": "ঘ) (-1, -3)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x + 2y = 3 .......(1) এবং x - y = 0<br />x = y ........... (2)<br />এখন, (1) নং হতে পাই x + 2x = 3<br />বা, 3x = 3<br />&there4; x = 1<br />(2) নং থেকে পাই, y = x = 1<br />&there4; (x, y) = (1, 1)</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x/3 - 2/y = 1 এবং x/4 + 3/y = 3 হলে y এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(1) নং &times; 1/4 - (2) নং &times; 1/3 হতে পাই,<br />x/12 - 1/2y - x/12 - 1/y = 1/4 -1<br />বা, - 1/2y - 1/y = - 3/4<br />বা, -1 -2/2y = - 3/4<br />বা, (-3)/2y = - 3/4<br />বা, 2y = 4<br />&there4; y = 2</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) x + y - 4 = 2x - 3y - 12 = 0 হলে 3x - 2y = ?", "option1": "ক) -16", "option2": "খ) -12", "option3": "গ) 12", "option4": "ঘ) 16", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x + y - 4 = 0...........