>বা, 1/mk &lt; 1/nk</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) xy &gt; 0 এবং yz &lt; 0 হলে নিচের কোনটি অবশ্যই ধনাত্মক সংখ্যা -", "option1": "ক) xy<sup>2</sup>z", "option2": "খ) xyz", "option3": "গ) xyz<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup>z", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>yz &lt; 0<br />&there4; y &gt; 0, z &lt; 0 অথবা y &lt; 0, z &gt; 0 ফলে z<sup>2</sup> &gt; 0<br />আবার, xy &gt; 0<br />&there4; xyz<sup>2</sup> &gt; 0<br /><br /></p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) 0 &lt; x &lt; 2 এবং y &gt; 0 হলে নিচের কোনটি xy এর মান -", "option1": "ক) অর্নিণেয়", "option2": "খ) -2", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>ধরি,<br />x = 1/2, y = 2<br />&there4; xy = 1/2.2 = 1</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) x/y &gt; 0 হলে নিচের কোনটি সত্য?", "option1": "ক) xy &lt; 0", "option2": "খ) xy &gt; 0", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup> &lt; 0", "option4": "ঘ) x-y &gt; 0", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x/y &gt; 0 হলে,<br /> x &gt; 0, y &gt; 0 অথবা, x &lt; 0, y &lt; 0<br />&there4; xy &gt; 0</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) ab &lt; 0 এবং a &lt; b হলে নিচের কোনটি ধনাত্মক?", "option1": "ক) a", "option2": "খ) ab<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) a<sup>2</sup>b", "option4": "ঘ) ab", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু, a &lt; b এবং ab &lt; 0<br />&there4; a &lt; 0 এবং b &gt; 0<br />&there4; a<sup>2</sup>b সর্বদা ধনাত্মক।</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1200000, "pk": 2582, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 2582}